OL,3,GNEWSAHome 'failed to look for missing
OL,4,Achildren'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA children's home was found to have
OL,7,F"serious and widespread failures" that
OL,8,Fmeant young people were not protected.
OL,10,FThe Salford children's home run by
OL,11,FCambian Childcare Ltd went from an
OL,12,F"outstanding" rating to "inadequate" in
OL,13,Fall areas, with Ofsted inspectors
OL,14,Ffinding "the experiences of children
OL,15,Fand young people are poor and they are
OL,16,Fnot making progress".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
