OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHome 'failed to look for missing
OL,4,Achildren'
OL,5,
OL,6,FProblems cited included staff not
OL,7,Flooking for children when they go
OL,8,Fmissing from home, "not being vigilant"
OL,9,Fwhen managing substance misuse risks,
OL,10,Fand not having full risk assessments
OL,11,Fand quality control documentation.
OL,13,FCambian Childcare Ltd said since the
OL,14,Finspection it has resolved issues
OL,15,Fraised in the report.
